OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mainly dry with
OL,6,Fbright or sunny spells and just the
OL,7,Fodd shower. Best of the warm sunny
OL,8,Fspells across the Borders and along
OL,9,Fthe Solway Coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA bright evening with any
OL,12,Fshowers dying out. A dry start to the
OL,13,Fnight but thicker cloud and patchy
OL,14,Frain will spread eastwards.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,17,Foutbreaks of rain. Best chance of dry
OL,18,Fand bright spells will be in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
